<title>UK: Brazil Synthetic sets 100 mln mark Apr 2012 bond.</title>
<headline>Brazil Synthetic sets 100 mln mark Apr 2012 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BRAZIL SYNTHETIC SOVEREIGN INVESTMENTS JERSEY LTD</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *13.00     MATURITY    25.APR.12</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.00    PAY DATE  S 27.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.75     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    1.25	SELL CONC  1.25</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALLABLE FROM 25.APR.00 WHEN COUPON STEPS-UP TO 9.50</p>
<p>		THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		AMORTISING CREDIT LINKED ISSUE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
